# Build-context allowlist: only these paths are sent to the Docker daemon.
# Everything else (.git, node_modules, dist, temp, .agents, docs, schemas, test,
# deploy templates, .env and every local configuration or credential) stays out.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!src
!scripts
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
